<title>USA: Group holds 10.1 pct Host Marriott stake.</title>
<headline>Group holds 10.1 pct Host Marriott stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by RCM Capital Management LLC said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Wednesday it holds a 10.1 percent stake in Host Marriott Corp, or 19,762,300 Class A common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Host Marriott in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company.  Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
